$ Original synthetic teaching model, not an assessed material database.
$ One invented atom A; elemental mass and reference metadata are placeholders.
$ Only 800 <= T <= 1200 K at p=100000 Pa is taught/checked.
ELEMENT A BLANK 1.0 0.0 0.0 !
TYPE_DEFINITION % SEQ * !
PHASE SOLID % 1 1 !
CONSTITUENT SOLID :A: !
PARAMETER G(SOLID,A;0) 800 1000-10*T; 1200 N !
PHASE LIQUID % 1 1 !
CONSTITUENT LIQUID :A: !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,A;0) 800 7000-16*T; 1200 N !
